<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= locale %>">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title><%= appTitle %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/client.css" />
</head>
<body>
    <h1><%= appTitle %> — <%= boardTitle %></h1>
    <p class="intro">
        Open this page in two tabs: drag cards between columns, rename them inline, add and
        delete. Every write is versioned, so two racing edits cannot both win — the loser is
        told it lost and rolls back to the server's card. Card events stream over
        <code>/ws/board/<%= boardId %></code> and a reconnect re-syncs the whole board first.
    </p>
    <!-- The inert custom element is upgraded when the client module defines it. -->
    <kanban-board data-board="<%= boardId %>" data-title="<%= boardTitle %>"></kanban-board>
    <script type="module" src="/static/client.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
